[0.0-3.5] caller: This is the power company. Your account is past due.
[4.1-5.6] elder: I paid last week.
[6.2-10.7] caller: We have no record. We will shut off your power in one hour.
[11.3-14.4] elder: In one hour? I have medicine in the fridge.
[15.0-19.5] caller: You can pay right now with a bitcoin ATM at the gas station.
[20.1-22.5] elder: I don't know how to do that.
[23.1-26.6] caller: I'll stay on the line and walk you through it.
